* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
# The mod writes HeadTracking.ini with CRLF. No .ini ships in the release ZIP -
# the mod generates it on first run - but the tracked copy at the repo root is
# the fixture config_defaults_tests byte-compares that generated text against,
# so checking it out as LF would fail the suite on every clone.
*.ini text eol=crlf
*.dll binary
*.asi binary
*.zip binary
*.gif binary
